    <briefdescription>
<para>GPU-callable functor that finds characteristic feet for logical-space advection with foot-finding in pseudo-physical space. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The advection field is expressed in logical <formula id="19">$ (r, \theta) $</formula> coordinates and is converted to pseudo-physical <formula id="21">$ (X_{pC}, Y_{pC}) $</formula> space before the characteristic equation is integrated. Constructed by <ref refid="classpolar__foot__finder__details_1_1ElementwiseLogicalAdvPseudoPhysFootFinderMem" kindref="compound">ElementwiseLogicalAdvPseudoPhysFootFinderMem</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
